  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "T. acidiphilum was grown under anaerobic conditions on a chemically defined medium (20) with CO2 as the carbon source, H2 as the electron donor, and sulfate as the electron acceptor."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "To adjust the pH of the medium to 4.8, 3 M HCl was added."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "The medium was dispensed in 5 ml portions into 17 ml Hungate tubes; the head space was filled with H2/CO2 (4 : 1, 151.9 kPa)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
